# Review finding 5: what staging costs a spawn on Windows. Windows 11, 22 logical CPUs, co-loaded by the
# other wave-2 lanes (numbers are an upper bound for an idle machine). Fix seat, 2026-09-25, at 2f93634.
#
# (1) stageBinary alone, the test binary (18,118,656 B) standing in for qompack.exe (13,451,776 B):
# go test ./internal/daemon/ -run '^$' -bench '^BenchmarkStageBinary$' -benchtime=40x -count=3 -v
    spawn_stage_test.go:344: staging C:\Users\Quant\AppData\Local\Temp\go-build2822531371\b001\daemon.test.exe (18118656 bytes)
